# Avaye Zaryab — Front-end

The **Avaye Zaryab** (آوای زریاب) website: a Next.js front-end that renders content
served by a headless WordPress backend, with motion built in via GSAP.

> A [Cyborg Tech Creative Agency](https://github.com/CyborgTech-co) project.
> Backend: [`zaryab_backend`](https://github.com/CyborgTech-co/zaryab_backend).

---

## Tech stack

| Layer | Technology |
|---|---|
| Framework | Next.js (App Router) |
| UI | React |
| Motion | GSAP (`@gsap/react`), react-fast-marquee |
| Data | axios against the WordPress REST API |
| Icons | react-icons |
| Styling | Tailwind CSS |

## Getting started

```bash
npm install
npm run dev
```

Then open [http://localhost:3000](http://localhost:3000).

Set the WordPress API base URL in the project's environment config so the
front-end can reach the [`zaryab_backend`](https://github.com/CyborgTech-co/zaryab_backend)
content API.

## Scripts

| Command | Does |
|---|---|
| `npm run dev` | Start the dev server |
| `npm run build` | Production build |
| `npm start` | Serve the production build |
| `npm run lint` | Lint the project |
